  m_text: 'If you are reading this, you are probably slowly drifting away from this
    text without knowing how to stop. Well, sucks to suck, loser.


    Wait, I am
    a tutorial prompt... *sighs in words*


    In order to stop drifting, get used
    to dridfing instead and contol the dirction of your drift by pressing [E] and
    [Q] to tilt your drone right/left.

    To stop forwards/backward drift put mouse
    cursor ablove/below safe circle as usual.


    In order to descent/ascent press
    [Space]/[R.Shift].


    Next prompt is to your right (my left) and lower then
    both of us.'
