  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Its me, WALL OF TEXT, scarer of tictoc children.


    Number on top of
    screen, below compass indicates rotation on y plane. Move cursor to the left/right
    of safe circle to stop rotating that number around 90.


    While holding [RMB]
    position of mouse cursor does not influences drone. Read following instuctions
    while holding [RMB] to not tilt the drone and execute these instructions without
    holding [RMB]. Can''t be that hard.


    Number directly on the left of borders
    circle signilazies Angle drone is tilted.


    At any point during tutorial
    press [Z] to freeze drone in the air and [X] to thaw it.


    In order to move
    forward, thaw drone and move mouse cursor below safe circle until value to the
    left of safe circle becomes [-10]. When it does so, return mouse cursor back
    inside.


    In order to stop moving, move cursor above safe circle and hold
    it there until Angle value becomes [0]. Then put mouse cursor back at the safe
    circle.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
