      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'That is it for moving. The only thing left to learn is shooting. Press
    [LMB] to fire a no-recoil weirdly 1960-coded matrix-ass looking gun on your left
    (yes, its suppose to be a little cannon. HOW COULD YOU NOT TELL???).


    Behind,
    to the right and below this tutorial prompt is a turret. During main game your
    goal is to find and destroy every turret on the map. Their method of retaliation
    is loking onto drone - which is harmless - and firing after about 5 seconds -
    which destroys drone instantly.


    Feel free to find ways to remove turret
    attention from you, explore empty map, die of map borders and press [ESC] > End
    Tutorial to return to main menu.'
